{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:22 2026-10-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:22 2026-10-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:22 2026-10-03 HKT</p><p>今（3日）中午12時32分，大埔漁安街碼頭對出海面，警方接報有船家救起一名疑遇溺的女子，當時仍清醒，稍後將她送往三門仔碼頭期間，女子已陷入昏迷，被送往大埔那打素醫院搶救。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"漁安街碼頭少女疑遇溺昏迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d53556771aa5ca65cc4a8da51b0c445/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_44_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"漁安街對開海面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1879153ebeb4c4409bf586cb4bcfb364/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_44_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少女稍後被送往三門仔碼頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76860730b665d0bf1ac3cbd5fb6275c7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_44_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少女被送往三門仔碼頭上岸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef9384c3e5a07c6f3318b71b50ca805c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_44_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少女被送往大埔那打素醫院救治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26e4564c7c7d405a794a1b300899c1cf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_14_17.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少女被送往大埔那打素醫院救治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd37038f29f46a538b817ebf6dea5cc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_13_14_16_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T07:58:40.837552+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}